==Battleground==
*2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Princess Head]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchis]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
- Upgrade worker cat to level 2 or use a rich cat, wait for the floating princess heads to reach your base, rush it down with cameraman, can can and other dps units. Once kerihime is open, wait for her to kick and then use awakened bahamut against her. The remaining enemies should not be a problem without her support.

